      "message": "Cover art is weird.\n\nThe new track we update to will include a (potentially) new image handle/URI. If it\u0027s new, the client will hit our provider with the URI, which will trigger the download from the remote device. Those images are cached, so long as they\u0027re needed by either the current metadata or the tree (if supported). So cover art is covered here.",
